#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "  To learn about other Tor bridges, you have several options listed "
#| "below.\n"
msgid ""
"To learn about other Tor bridges, you have several options listed below."
msgstr "  Há diversas formas de obter outras pontes do Tor:\n"

#. type: Plain text
msgid "You can use *obfs4* and *WebTunnel* bridges in Tails right now."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "  <div class=\"tip\">\n"
#| "  <p>None of these options is easy to do from Tails, so we recommend that you\n"
#| "  learn about several bridges from your regular computer <i>before starting\n"
#| "  Tails</i> and store the bridge lines in a text document on separate USB\n"
#| "  stick.</p>\n"
msgid ""
"<div class=\"tip\">\n"
"<p>None of these options is easy to do from Tails, so we recommend that you\n"
"learn about several bridges from your regular computer <i>before starting\n"
"Tails</i> and store the bridge lines in a text document on separate USB\n"
"stick.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"  <div class=\"tip\">\n"
"  <p>Nenhuma dessas opções é fácil de fazer a partir do Tails, então recomendamos que você\n"
"  obtenha diversas pontes a partir do seu computador usual <i>antes de iniciar o\n"
"  Tails</i> e armazene as linhas com as informações sobre pontes em um documento de texto\n"
"um  pendrive USB separado.</p>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "  <p>After you restarted on Tails, you can copy one of these bridge lines from\n"
#| "  this other USB stick into <i>Tor Connection</i>.</p>\n"
msgid ""
"<p>After you restarted on Tails, you can copy one of these bridge lines from\n"
"this other USB stick into <i>Tor Connection</i>.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"  <p>Deopis que você reiniciar no Tails, você pode copiar uma dessas linhas com uma ponte\n"
"  deste outro pendrive USB para o <i>Tor Connection</i>.</p>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "  </div>\n"
msgid "</div>\n"
msgstr "  </div>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "  Even someone who knows your bridge cannot know what you are doing "
#| "online from\n"
#| "  Tails.\n"
msgid ""
"Even someone who knows your bridge cannot know what you are doing online "
"from Tails."
msgstr ""
"  Mesmo que alguém saiba qual ponte você está usando, não pode saber o que "
"você está fazendo online a partir do\n"
"  Tails.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
msgid "**Website**"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  You can visit <https://bridges.torproject.org/options>.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "    We recommend doing so from a different\n"
#| "    local network if you want to hide that you are connecting to Tor.\n"
msgid ""
"  We recommend doing so from a different\n"
"  local network if you want to hide that you are connecting to Tor.\n"
msgstr ""
"    Recomendamos que você faça isso a partir de uma\n"
"    rede local diferente caso você queira ocultar o fato de que está se conectando à rede Tor.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
msgid "**Email**"
msgstr "**Email**"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "    You can send an empty email to\n"
#| "    <a href=\"mailto:bridges@torproject.org\">bridges@torproject.org</a> from a\n"
#| "    Gmail or Riseup email address.\n"
msgid ""
"  You can send an empty email to\n"
"  <a href=\"mailto:bridges@torproject.org\">bridges@torproject.org</a> from a\n"
"  Gmail or Riseup email address.\n"
msgstr ""
"    Você pode enviar um email vazio para\n"
"    <a href=\"mailto:bridges@torproject.org\">bridges@torproject.org</a> a partir de\n"
"    um endereço de email Gmail ou Riseup.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "    Sending the email reveals to Gmail or Riseup that you are trying to\n"
#| "    connect to Tor but not to someone who monitors your Internet connection.\n"
msgid ""
"  Sending the email reveals to Gmail or Riseup that you are trying to\n"
"  connect to Tor but not to someone who monitors your Internet connection.\n"
msgstr ""
"    Enviando o email, você revela para o Gmail ou para o Riseup que você está tentando\n"
"    se conectar à rede Tor, mas não para alguém que esteja monitorando sua conexão à Internet.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
msgid "**Telegram**"
msgstr "**Telegram**"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "    You can send the message `/bridges` to\n"
#| "    [@GetBridgesBot](https://t.me/GetBridgesBot) on *Telegram*.\n"
msgid ""
"  You can send the message `/bridges` to\n"
"  [@GetBridgesBot](https://t.me/GetBridgesBot) on *Telegram*.\n"
msgstr ""
"    Você pode enviar a mensagem `/bridges` para o\n"
"    [@GetBridgesBot](https://t.me/GetBridgesBot) no *Telegram*.\n"

